  "title": "Pork Roast with Thyme",
  "description": "This flavor-infused pork roast with thyme recipe studs pork roast with garlic, roasts on a bed of bay leaves, and bastes with cider vinegar and thyme.",
  "authors": [
    "Teresa C. Rouzer"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-09-30T14:29:41-04:00",
